<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Resource Links</title>

  <p>
    Here are some resources to help you learn more about <pretext /> and how to use it.
  </p>
  <tabular top="minor" bottom="minor" left="minor" right="minor">
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://pretextbook.org"><pretext /> Homepage</url></cell>
      <cell>The <pretext /> homepage is a great place to start learning more about the project and its capabilities. It includes links to documentation, help forums, and more.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://runestone.academy/ns/books/published/debookrs/"><pretext /> Guide</url></cell>
      <cell>The <pretext /> Guide is a comprehensive resource for learning how to use <pretext />. It includes detailed documentation, examples, and tutorials.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://pretextbook.org/community.html">Help Forums</url></cell>
      <cell>The <pretext /> Help Forums are a great place to ask questions, share your work, and connect with other members of the <pretext /> community.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://groups.google.com/g/pretext-announce"><pretext /> announcements</url></cell>
      <cell>Stay updated on the latest news and developments in the <pretext /> community.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://github.com/pretextbook/pretext/issues">GitHub Issues</url></cell>
      <cell>Report bugs or request features on the <pretext /> GitHub repository.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://discord.gg/pretext">Discord Server</url></cell>
      <cell>Join the <pretext /> Discord server for real-time discussions and support.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://mathtech.org">MathTech</url></cell>
      <cell>Explore the MathTech website for additional resources and information about <pretext />.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://www.youtube.com/@MathTechOrg/videos">Videos</url></cell>
      <cell>Watch tutorial videos and presentations about <pretext />.</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><url href="https://runestone.academy/">Runestone Academy</url></cell>
      <cell>Runestone Academy is the platform that hosts interactive textbooks created with <pretext />. It provides a user-friendly interface for both authors and readers, making it easy to create, publish, and access interactive educational content.</cell>
    </row>
  </tabular>

</chapter>